The project modifies scheduling, readiness publication, transport, packet layout and
consumer fusion. It does not claim unmodified upstream Flux ReduceScatter behavior.
Original repository license is retained in LICENSE.

TACO arithmetic in src/taco/codec.cu is adapted from COCCL_TACO
commit ca717e05b6dd6d21fff4d2617d209c95be63f3ef (taco-new-feature).
The CUDA warp/register ownership is based on TempName-New/tools/5090/phase6/op3_codec.cu.
The new code uses SoA packets and ascending-source BF16 reduction.

